      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i woke up with these crazy hives all over my arms and chest... i think it might be my seasonal allergies acting up again cuz the pollen is insane lately. but my throat feels kinda tight too?? like i cant swallow as easy. should i just take an extra dose of my allergy meds or do i need to go see someone?",
