      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i'm just worried about going to the er if its just allergies... it's super expensive and i'm pretty sure i just need more antihistamine. like, could the throat thing just be because my throat is dry or my glands are swollen from the pollen? if i take another pill now, how long should i wait to see if it works before i actually worry?",
