      "content": "okay i'll try taking another one then and wait. honestly i'm pretty sure it's just the pollen. if the throat thing doesn't go away in like an hour, is there anything else i can just do at home to make the swelling go down? like maybe some gargling or something? i really don't want to deal with a hospital visit if i can help it.",
